{
    "title": "Vantaca Home",
    "description": "Vantaca Home is a convenient and mobile-friendly way to interact with your community association. This app makes it easier than ever to access your community association portal. Simply log in using your existing portal credentials and select your management company.\r\n\r\nStay informed about dues, check your current balance, review recent payments, and access a comprehensive account payment history. Whether you need to track monthly dues, evaluate special assessments, or manage recurring payments, the Vantaca Home app provides a clear and simple way to manage your payments.\r\n\r\nThe app offers seamless switching between accounts, so you can navigate and oversee various properties in a community within a single login. Monitor each property's dues, streamline payment processes, and enjoy the convenience of centralized management.\r\n\r\nCOMING SOON: Vantaca Home will be your mobile gateway to enhanced community interaction. Soon, you\u2019ll be able to use the app to stay up to date with important community announcements and receive notifications about events, maintenance updates, policy changes, and more.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022\tView your balance\r\n\u2022\tMake a payment\r\n\u2022\tReview recent payments\r\n\u2022\tReview account payment history\r\n\u2022\tSwitch seamlessly between accounts if you own multiple properties",
    "descriptionHTML": "Vantaca Home is a convenient and mobile-friendly way to interact with your community association. This app makes it easier than ever to access your community association portal. Simply log in using your existing portal credentials and select your management company.<br><br>Stay informed about dues, check your current balance, review recent payments, and access a comprehensive account payment history. Whether you need to track monthly dues, evaluate special assessments, or manage recurring payments, the Vantaca Home app provides a clear and simple way to manage your payments.<br><br>The app offers seamless switching between accounts, so you can navigate and oversee various properties in a community within a single login. Monitor each property&#39;s dues, streamline payment processes, and enjoy the convenience of centralized management.<br><br>COMING SOON: Vantaca Home will be your mobile gateway to enhanced community interaction. Soon, you\u2019ll be able to use the app to stay up to date with important community announcements and receive notifications about events, maintenance updates, policy changes, and more.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022\tView your balance<br>\u2022\tMake a payment<br>\u2022\tReview recent payments<br>\u2022\tReview account payment history<br>\u2022\tSwitch seamlessly between accounts if you own multiple properties",
